			"notes": "Restores 1.3.0 source (missing from GitHub, see #7) and fixes the fluid blockstate log spam (#5).\n\n- `respite-creators-1.3.0.jar` — built from `1.20.x`, includes both the legacy `farmersrespite` recipes and the updated `farmersrespiterefabricated` (Convention Tags) recipe set.\n- `respite-creators-1.3.0-FDR.jar` — built from `1.20.x-FDR`, includes only the updated `farmersrespiterefabricated` recipe set.\n- Adds Mexican Spanish (es_mx) translation, thanks to @TheLegendofSaram (#6)."
